SUMMARY:Building Investment-Ready Economies: The Role of Policy\, Capital\, and Institutions
DESCRIPTION:Sustainable investment doesn't happen by chance\, it is built on the strength of institutions\, the effectiveness of policy\, and the strategic deployment of capital. In this fireside chat\, Osama Saleh draws on decades of leadership across banking\, government\, and investment to explore what makes economies truly investment-ready. From fostering investor confidence and strengthening financial ecosystems to enabling private sector growth\, the discussion will offer practical insights into the foundations that attract long-term capital and drive sustainable economic development.
