SUMMARY:Unlocking the Power of AI with Microsoft Copilot: From Prompting to Building Agents
DESCRIPTION:Discover how artificial intelligence is transforming the way we work and how Microsoft Copilot can help individuals and organizations unlock its full potential. In this interactive session\, attendees will gain a practical understanding of AI fundamentals\, responsible AI practices\, effective prompting techniques\, and real-world productivity scenarios. The session will also introduce the next evolution of AI at work by demonstrating how to build AI-powered agents that automate business processes\, enhance decision-making\, and support organizational goals.
