SUMMARY:Cybersecurity as a Corporate Innovation Enabler
DESCRIPTION:As corporates across the region accelerate digital transformation\, cybersecurity risks are scaling in parallel\, yet security is often treated as a brake on innovation. This panel reframes cybersecurity as a competitive enabler\, featuring CISOs who have built security architectures that allow organizations to move fast without compromising resilience.
