SUMMARY:Logistics Insights Every E-commerce Seller Needs in 2026 (Egypt & KSA)
DESCRIPTION:Sellers see one side of the order: the sale. Couriers see the other side: the address that does not exist\, the phone that\nnever answers\, the cash the customer did not have ready. That gap is where margin disappears. Drawing on data from\nmillions of shipments across 15+ couriers in Egypt and Saudi Arabia\, this session shows sellers what happens to their\norders after pickup\, why so many fail on the first attempt\, and what to change to get more orders delivered\, faster\, at\nlower cost.
CATEGORIES:[THEME] CORPORATE INNOVATION
LOCATION:(CAI) STAGE 04: Ghurnata - Workshops B\, Egypt
