SUMMARY:Advancing Universal Healthcare Through Technology
DESCRIPTION:The Universal Health Insurance program is transforming Egypt’s healthcare landscape\, with technology playing a critical role in making healthcare more accessible\, efficient\, and patient-centered. This fireside chat explores the progress of the UHIA and the key milestones achieved so far\, while examining how technology companies can contribute to accelerating the program’s impact. The discussion will highlight opportunities for collaboration\, digital innovation\, and scalable tech solutions that can support the future of universal healthcare.
