SUMMARY:The Simplified Tax System represents a genuine opportunity for businesses to grow and expand
DESCRIPTION:As Egypt continues to simplify and modernize its tax framework\, the Simplified Tax System is designed to make compliance more accessible and create a clearer environment for businesses to operate and grow. This fireside chat explores what the system means in practice for businesses\, how it can reduce the complexity of tax compliance\, and what opportunities it creates for entrepreneurs and companies looking to formalize\, expand\, and scale. The conversation will also look at how greater tax clarity and a more streamlined relationship between businesses and the tax authority can support sustainable growth and contribute to a stronger business environment in Egypt.
