SUMMARY:FRA Sandbox: From Regulatory Testing to Market Innovation
DESCRIPTION:Regulatory sandboxes are becoming an important mechanism for enabling responsible innovation across non-banking financial services. This session explores how the FRA Sandbox is helping bring technology-enabled solutions from controlled testing into the market\, using current live projects as practical examples. The discussion will examine how regulatory innovation can support market development\, attract investment\, enable new financial models\, and strengthen consumer protection.
