DESCRIPTION:A focused conversation on how governments\, technology companies\, courts\, and businesses are responding to the rapid evolution of AI. The discussion will explore who should shape the rules governing emerging AI systems\, how regulation can keep pace with innovation\, and what responsible AI governance means as increasingly powerful technologies move into everyday use.
