SUMMARY:Scaling Without the Overhead: How Modern Businesses Build Lean\, High-Performance Operations
DESCRIPTION:As competition intensifies and efficiency becomes a priority\, businesses are moving away from traditional structures and embracing more agile operating models. This session explores how companies can leverage outsourcing\, technology\, distributed teams\, and specialized service providers to scale while maintaining focus on their core business.
