SUMMARY:From Regulation to Opportunity: What’s Next for FinTech in Egypt?
DESCRIPTION:Egypt’s fintech ecosystem is entering a new phase as regulatory frameworks evolve to accommodate new financial products\, business models\, and technologies. This fireside chat explores what the latest regulatory developments mean for fintech founders\, financial institutions\, and investors\, and how regulation can move beyond compliance to enable responsible innovation and market growth.\n\nThe conversation will look at where the regulatory landscape is heading\, how regulators are approaching emerging fintech models\, and what innovators need to understand as they move from experimentation to market adoption. It will also explore the role of regulatory sandboxes in bridging innovation and regulation\, and what it will take to build a fintech ecosystem that is both more dynamic and more trusted.
