SUMMARY:The New Investment Equation: What Will Unlock Egypt’s Next Wave of Capital?
DESCRIPTION:As Egypt works to strengthen its investment landscape and unlock new sources of capital\, the equation extends beyond attracting investors to creating the conditions for investment\, innovation\, and sustainable growth. This fireside explores the Ministry’s efforts to support investment and innovation in Egypt\, strengthen the investment environment\, and create stronger pathways for capital to reach high-potential businesses and opportunities. The conversation will examine what investors are looking for\, where new opportunities are emerging\, and what it will take to translate investor interest into long-term investment and growth.
