SUMMARY:Growth Strategy Configurator
DESCRIPTION:A strategy only works when all its pieces fit together. This session walks you through building one\, step by step.\n\nYou'll start with the foundations\, assess where your business stands today\, and choose your growth direction. From there you'll decide where to compete and how to get there\, then set your competitive position and balance between protecting your core business and building something new.\n\nYou leave with a complete strategy for your own business.\n\nLearning Outcomes:\n\nIntroduction to Growth Strategy Configurator\n\nStrategic Foundation Building\n\nStrategic Direction Assessment\n\nStrategic Growth\n\nStrategic Location and Implementation Methods\n\nCompetitive Stance and Innovation Balance\n\n
