SUMMARY:Beyond Apps: Why Healthcare Ecosystems Need Integration
DESCRIPTION:The era of the 'standalone' health app is fading. To truly transform patient outcomes\, fragmented silos like clinics\, pharmacies\, labs\, and insurance must converge into a unified ecosystem. This panel examines the strategic necessity of cross-sector integration\, exploring how digital platforms can collaborate with traditional players to move beyond simple transactions. We unpack the operational and strategic shifts required to build a comprehensive\, interoperable infrastructure that transforms disjointed services into a cohesive\, patient-centered healthcare experience.
