SUMMARY:Challenges of Scaling up; The Elephant in the Room
DESCRIPTION:Scaling a business is not simply about growing revenue\, customers\, or headcount. As organizations expand\, the structures\, leadership models\, talent\, and ways of working that enabled early growth can become barriers to the next stage. This workshop explores the often-overlooked organizational challenges that emerge during scale-up — from restructuring and talent management to leadership alignment\, organizational culture\, and evolving operating models. Participants will examine the “elephant in the room” of scaling: the internal transformation required to ensure the organization can grow without losing its ability to perform\, adapt\, and innovate.
