SUMMARY:From Idea to Market: Launching a SportsTech Startup in Egypt
DESCRIPTION:Launching a SportsTech Startup in Egypt The intersection of sport and technology is generating some of the most exciting entrepreneurial opportunities of our time — and Egypt is beginning to stake its claim. This panel is a practical\, no-filter guide for founders and aspiring entrepreneurs navigating the journey from concept to commercialization in the Egyptian market. Experienced startup founders\, investors\, and ecosystem builders will share what it takes to validate a SportsTech idea\, secure early funding\, land your first club or federation partnership\, and scale with intent in a region full of untapped potential.
