DESCRIPTION:Not every opportunity is worth taking. This session helps you tell the difference.\n\nYou'll learn what makes a growth opportunity real\, explore the different types available to your business\, and build your own Ideal Opportunity Profile — a simple filter for judging opportunities quickly and consistently.\n\nThe session ends with an introduction to Business Daily Insights\, a tool for tracking opportunities as they appear so you build a live pipeline instead of a list you forget about.\n\nLearning outcomes:\n\nUnderstand the Nature and Importance of Growth Opportunities\n\nIdentify Different Growth Opportunity Types\n\nApply the concept of Ideal Opportunity Profiling\n\nIntroduction to Business Daily Insights (our opportunity tracking tool)
CATEGORIES:STARTUP INNOVATION
