SUMMARY:The Technology Is Ready. Are We? - Leading Organizations Through the AI Transformation
DESCRIPTION:AI\, automation and connected technologies are advancing faster than many organisations can absorb. But increasingly\, the biggest barriers to transformation are not technological\, they are organisational and human.\n\nThis conversation explores what happens after the technology becomes available: how leaders redesign organisations around new capabilities\, bring people through change\, build the right skills and trust\, and move beyond technology adoption to measurable transformation.\n\nDrawing on experiences across mobility\, healthcare\, and business transformation\, the discussion would look at the leadership\, culture\, talent and operating models required to turn technological capability into real-world impact.\n\nThe central question we would like the conversation to explore is:\n\nIf the technology works\, what is actually stopping us?
