SUMMARY:Meet & Greet: Sara Elkady
DESCRIPTION:Sara Elkady is Senior Vice President Highspeed & Intercity at Siemens Mobility\, leading a global business focused on shaping the future of sustainable high-speed and intercity rail transportation. Over the past two decades\, she has led international teams across strategy\, business development\, product management\, and execution\, contributing to major mobility programs and helping translate technology into meaningful business and societal impact. Her focus includes advancing sustainable rail\, accelerating digital and AI-driven transformation\, and developing high-performing teams and future leaders\, grounded in a belief that diverse teams create the greatest value when united around a shared purpose.\n\n
