SUMMARY:Workplace Wellness in a Fast-Paced Tech Industries
DESCRIPTION:Tech environments thrive on agility and speed\, but constant pressure often leads to burnout and diminishing returns. This workshop bridges the gap between high-performance culture and mental sustainability. Designed for leaders and teams in demanding environments\, we explore evidence-based strategies to build psychological safety\, manage chronic stress\, and maintain cognitive peak performance without compromising mental health. Learn how to architect a work environment that nurtures resilience\, keeps morale high\, and sustains productivity in the long run.
