SUMMARY:Beyond Coding: How AI Is Transforming Software Testing
DESCRIPTION:AI is changing how software is built\, but its impact goes far beyond writing code. In this hands-on workshop\, discover how AI can transform software testing and quality engineering—from generating robust test cases to improving test automation through effective prompt engineering.\n\nUsing a real-world example and a practical AI-powered tool built around Playwright\, participants will explore how to structure effective prompts\, generate and maintain automated tests\, and integrate AI into their existing testing workflows.\n\nWhether you are a developer\, QA engineer\, product manager\, business analyst\, CTO\, or technology leader\, this workshop will provide practical insights and techniques to help you leverage AI to build and validate more reliable software.
