SUMMARY:The Growth Equation: From Business to Scale
DESCRIPTION:Scaling a business takes more than a great idea. It requires a clear business model\, strong execution\, and the ability to turn early traction into sustainable growth.\n\nIn this fireside chat\, Zeyad Elhadary\, founder of Naydin shares the business decisions behind scaling two brands\, from identifying market opportunities to building teams and strengthening operations. The conversation explores the realities of growth\, the challenges founders face\, and what it takes to build businesses with long-term potential.
