SUMMARY:Unlocking Egypt’s Circular Economy Potential: A Multi-Stakeholder Dialogue on Waste Management Innovation Ecosystems
DESCRIPTION:An open strategic discussion bringing together funders\, policymakers\, incubator leaders\, and other relevant ecosystem actors. Using EcoScale’s on-the-ground implementation in Qena\, Luxor\, and Asyut as a case study\, the discussion would explore systemic gaps in&nbsp\;Egypt’s green innovation ecosystem and opportunities to replicate or co-fund the model in additional governorates.\n
