SUMMARY:The Fintech Convergence: Where Payments\, Credit\, Savings & Wealth Meet
DESCRIPTION:The boundaries between payments\, credit\, savings\, and wealth are increasingly disappearing as fintech companies build more connected financial ecosystems. This panel brings together leaders across different parts of the financial services landscape to explore how these models are converging\, where the biggest opportunities are emerging across MENA\, and how fintech companies can collaborate to create more accessible\, connected\, and customer-centric financial services.\n\n
CATEGORIES:FINTECH
LOCATION:(ALX) Stage 01: The Great Hall\, Egypt
SEQUENCE:0
UID:865eff7255317c9778215e7dac7db6c6
