SUMMARY:Egyptian Startups: Navigating Challenges and Opportunities in Emerging Technology Trends
DESCRIPTION:As Egypt’s entrepreneurial ecosystem shifts toward sustainable value creation\, frontier technologies—from generative AI and intelligent automation to deep tech—offer transformative upside alongside distinct local bottlenecks. This panel brings together pioneering founders\, investors\, and ecosystem leaders to unpack how homegrown startups navigate talent dynamics\, infrastructure constraints\, and capital access to convert emerging technology into scalable\, market-tested ventures across MENA.
