SUMMARY:Unlocking the Future of Digital Assets: Tokenization
DESCRIPTION:This panel explores the future of money market funds through tokenization\, showcasing the joint project between Tarmiz and Granite within the FRA Sandbox. The discussion will examine how tokenization can enhance accessibility\, efficiency\, transparency\, and the overall investor experience\, while highlighting the practical insights and regulatory learnings that may emerge from live testing.
