SUMMARY:Strategy in Times of Uncertainties
DESCRIPTION:Markets change fast\, and waiting for clarity is not a strategy. This session gives you practical frameworks for making solid decisions when conditions keep shifting. You'll learn how to spot opportunities that appear during volatility\, see how real businesses adapted when their markets were disrupted\, and build the confidence to act in complex situations without waiting for perfect information.&nbsp\;Participants will learn proven frameworks for making strategic decisions during uncertain times\, identify opportunities hidden within market volatility and disruption\, discover how successful businesses adapt to changing conditions\, and build greater confidence in navigating complex business environments.\n\n
CATEGORIES:STARTUP INNOVATION
