SUMMARY:The Connected AI Stack: How LLMs Transform EdTech Operations
DESCRIPTION:Most startups are already using ChatGPT\, but very few are unlocking its real potential.\nThe real power of AI begins when Large Language Models become connected to your existing systems your CRM\, LMS\, Notion\, Google Workspace\, customer support platform\, marketing tools\, and internal knowledge base.\nIn this session\, we’ll explore how modern AI integrations enable startups to automate repetitive work\, improve decision-making\, personalize learner experiences\, and empower every team to work faster without replacing people.\n
