SUMMARY:Gamification at Work: Can Game Design Transform How We Work?
DESCRIPTION:As companies search for new ways to improve engagement\, productivity\, and retention\, gamification is increasingly being applied in the workplace. From employee training to performance systems\, game design principles are reshaping how people interact with work. But does gamification deliver real impact\, or is it just a trend? This panel explores how game design can be applied beyond entertainment\, and what it means for the future of work.
