SUMMARY:When Capital Changes the Bigger Picture
DESCRIPTION:What happens when investment is measured not only by financial returns\, but by the broader change it can create across economies\, communities\, and the environment?\n\nThis panel brings together impact-focused investors and a public-sector perspective to explore how capital can drive meaningful and lasting impact across different sectors. The conversation will look at how investment decisions can influence economic development\, environmental outcomes\, and the future of industries and communities.\n\nWith perspectives spanning impact investing\, environmental finance\, nature tech\, private-sector strategy\, and entrepreneurship\, the panel will explore where capital can create meaningful impact and what it takes to translate investment into long-term outcomes.
