SUMMARY:From Early Capital to Scale: Building the Right Funding Mix
DESCRIPTION:As startups grow\, their funding needs change. What works at the early stage may not be enough to support expansion\, regional growth\, or institutional scale.\n\nThis session looks at how founders and investors can build the right funding mix across different stages of growth\, from early-stage capital to venture funding and institutional investment. The discussion will explore how different sources of capital can work together to support scale while balancing growth\, ownership\, risk\, and long-term value creation.
CATEGORIES:CAPITAL CONNECT
