SUMMARY:Gold in the Fintech Era: Shariah Controls for Trading Gold Through Financial Platforms and Applications
DESCRIPTION:This workshop addresses the Shariah controls for trading gold in light of financial technology\, across four key themes:\nThe Shariah foundation of gold as a ribawi asset and the governing principles for its trade.\nConstructive possession (Qabd) in the digital age and its practical applications.\nAn anatomy of gold investment products offered through financial platforms and applications\, highlighting common Shariah issues and pitfalls.\nShariah governance and Shariah audit of digital platforms in accordance with the adopted Shariah standards.
CATEGORIES:FINTECH
