SUMMARY:Design Your Al Startup Team with Advanced Agentic Al
DESCRIPTION:Investors usually assess the efficiency of Al startups' economics and capital use. In contrast\, Al startup founders constantly look for ways to scale operations without increasing headcount or burn rate early in the startup lifecycle. Hence\, designing an advanced\, Agentic Al-powered "Digital Team" for the "Al Startup" gives them an actionable blueprint for running lean. A team built on advanced Agentic Al enables modern\, highly scalable operating models. This workshop goes beyond simple Al agents\, offering technical depth in multi-agent organizational hierarchy\, how to train your agents' team on your startup's work\, and cooperation logic.
