SUMMARY:Beyond the Spotlight: Turning Stories into Innovation
DESCRIPTION:Success doesn't always follow a straight path. After decades in the entertainment industry\, Samah Anwar is building a new chapter as the founder of an AI-powered content platform. This fireside chat explores the power of reinvention\, the opportunities technology is creating for the creative industries\, and how embracing continuous learning can unlock entirely new career paths. From storytelling to startups\, discover how innovation is reshaping what it means to build\, create\, and lead.
