SUMMARY:Your First Angel Check: What Investors Don’t Tell Founders
DESCRIPTION:A practical session for early stage founders preparing to raise their first angel round.\n\nI’ll share lessons from both sides of the table as a founder\, angel investor\, and startup advisor\, covering:\n\n* What investors actually look for\n* When you’re ready to raise\n* Valuation and dilution\n* How to approach investors\n* Common fundraising mistakes and red flags\n* What really happens behind the scenes before the check\n\nThe session will be practical\, story driven\, and based on real startup experiences\, with clear takeaways founders can use immediately.
CATEGORIES:CAPITAL CONNECT
