DTEND:20261005T144000Z
SUMMARY:Grow Without Breaking
DESCRIPTION:The thing that worked when you built it alone starts cracking the moment it actually grows. More demand\, more people\, decisions you used to make in your head that now have to be made out loud. The real question isn't whether to grow. It's whether you need a new structure right now\, or you're just adding complexity to look more serious. This is a hands-on session for founders past the "just me" stage\, figuring out what comes next.
CATEGORIES:STARTUP INNOVATION
