SUMMARY:Building the Bridges: Strengthening Egypt's Entrepreneurial Ecosystem
DESCRIPTION:A joint UNIDO-NGIN-GIZ discussion on how Egypt's existing entrepreneurship programmes and ecosystem actors can work together to strengthen the cleantech and climate innovation pipeline. Following the entrepreneur's journey from technology and early support to investment\, customers and scale\, the panel will identify where key handoffs break down\, who should own them\, and three practical bridges that participating organizations can build together.
