SUMMARY:Inside the Deal: Building Investment Kits\, Finding the Right Investor\, Surviving Due Diligence
DESCRIPTION:You have a company\, a deck\, and a meeting with an investor next week. What happens next?\nMost people never find out until they are already in it. An SME investment moves through\nstages most founders only see from the outside. This session walks you through everything that\nsits between the first conversation and the signature. Building the investment kit before anyone\nsees your numbers\, finding the investor whose money comes with something behind it\, whether\nthat is market access\, connections\, or the discipline to scale\, and surviving due diligence\, where\nmore deals die than at any other stage
CATEGORIES:CAPITAL CONNECT
