DESCRIPTION:What does it really take to turn a game idea into a successful product? This guided interactive show takes the audience through the full journey of game development — from concept and design to publishing and monetization. Along the way\, participants engage with simple decisions and real scenarios\, gaining a clear understanding of how games are built and how they become sustainable businesses.
