SUMMARY:Leading Beyond the Algorithm: The Human Skills That Make AI Work
DESCRIPTION:Artificial intelligence can generate ideas\, analyze information\, and accelerate execution—but it cannot replace leadership.\nIn this practical session\, Marwan El Messiry explores why successful AI transformation depends less on technology alone and more on the ability of leaders to create clarity\, engage people\, make sound decisions\, and turn insights into action.\nParticipants will learn how to avoid common AI-adoption mistakes\, strengthen team ownership\, and use technology to improve performance without losing the human connection that drives trust\, creativity\, and execution.
