SUMMARY:Overview of E-commerce and Tax Incentives – A NEW BEGINNING
DESCRIPTION:As Egypt’s e-commerce ecosystem continues to expand\, understanding the evolving tax framework has become increasingly important for online businesses\, entrepreneurs\, and digital commerce platforms. This workshop provides a practical overview of the tax landscape affecting e-commerce businesses\, including key compliance considerations\, tax obligations\, and available incentives. Led by members of the Egyptian Tax Authority’s E-Commerce Unit\, the session will help participants better understand the current framework\, navigate their responsibilities\, and identify opportunities to build more compliant and sustainable e-commerce businesses.
