DTSTART:20261005T160000Z
DTEND:20261005T170000Z
SUMMARY:You're the Leader Now! 5Decisions Nobody Prepares You For
DESCRIPTION:Leadership rarely fails on one big decision. It fails in the small calls made under pressure — stepping in because it's faster\, holding a decision because reversing it looks weak\, letting a problem circle a room that nobody owns.\nThis is not a talk about leadership. Khaled El Dessouky puts the room into five real decisions\, one at a time. Participants choose\, defend the choice\, and then unpack how the thinking has to change once results stop depending only on your own work.\nDrawing on 25+ years leading multinational organizations across seven industries\, the session is built for founders\, team leads and anyone whose results now depend on other people.\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:STARTUP INNOVATION
